  "idea": "Automated holiday and time-off calendar sync across distributed teams",
  "text": "You can manage employee time off across twelve countries with zero spreadsheet headaches. Tracking personal leave and disparate national holidays manually leads to frequent payroll calculation errors. Outdated trackers fail to catch overlapping absences, leaving customer support queues completely unstaffed during product releases. Connecting Deel HR with Slack workflows centralizes vacation requests, approvals, and team calendar overlays automatically. You eliminate admin chaos while protecting continuous coverage.",
